sequenceDiagram
    participant FE as Backoffice
    participant GW as API Gestion
    participant GAL as Galeries Service
    participant S3 as Stockage Service

    FE->>GW: POST /photos [JWT] multipart{fichier, titre?}
    GW->>GAL: Transmettre fichier
    GAL->>S3: Stocker image
    S3-->>GAL: URL fichier
    GAL-->>GW: 201 Created {photo_id, url}
    GW-->>FE: 201 Created
    